00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:42.330
<i>Master Muneshige won't be Master Muneshige anymore!</i>

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:45.370
Vice-president,

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:49.490
I would like permission to enter the battlefront.

00:19:50.670 --> 00:19:54.630
Aren't you weaker than your husband,
Muneshige Tachibana?

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:58.350
Tes. If I am strong enough to defeat

00:19:58.350 --> 00:20:00.340
Musashi Ariadust Academy,

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:01.910
it will prove that there must have been some

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:05.130
misunderstanding in the 1st Special Agent's loss

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:07.800
since he is stronger than me.

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:13.170
Hiya!

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:14.540
Hi, there!

00:20:17.470 --> 00:20:18.800
What is it?

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:24.030
We have picked up Musashi's
presence in the western sky.

00:20:24.800 --> 00:20:28.390
Same Day at 9:45 A.M.
Off the Northern Shores Above the Ocean, Shimonoseki

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:36.620
Is something the matter?

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.910
It sounds strange...

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:44.220
Aren't those Tres España ships?

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:48.060
Warning!

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:50.710
It's Tres España's offensive warships!

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:53.520
There's two Krakens and six Wyverns!

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:57.320
They're roughly 500 meters above Okutama.

00:20:57.820 --> 00:21:01.570
<i>I have identified Tres España's
Kraken-class San Lorenzo.</i>

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:05.070
<i>It should take 3 minutes and 12 seconds to land. Over.</i>

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:08.940
By striking first, they've claimed they are
fighting for a just cause.

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:12.560
enirhS ugnamneT onatiK
ENIVID
NOISSIMSNART

00:21:09.440 --> 00:21:11.600
Tres España's merely seizing an intruding ship

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:15.580
that's delivering auxiliary goods to England.

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:19.380
They'll drop off about 200 men.

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:21.780
Kitano

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.800
This is an assault, not an invasion.

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:25.550
It'll be over quick if we can fend them off.

00:21:25.960 --> 00:21:30.440
You are welcome to phrase it like so: "You must win!"

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:31.820
Here they come!

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:34.520
The vanguard is
Tres España's land forces!

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:36.470
On your mark!

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:38.260
Mark!

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:40.020
Get set!

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:42.520
Go, all eight ships!

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:46.820
Nani ga mieru?

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:46.820
What do you see?

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:56.080
Ari no mama no kimi wa tsuyoku naru made itoshisa wo tojite

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:56.080
You've closed yourself off to love until you grow innately strong

00:21:55.690 --> 00:21:58.500
Everyone, pitch!

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:59.300
Nani wo kiku no?

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:59.300
What are you listening to?

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:07.740
Himitsu no kobeya de inishie no hibi katarou ka?

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:07.740
Shall I tell you about days long past in our secret little room?

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:08.630
It's Tres España's Four Balls of Death!

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:14.580
Kioku ni dakarete, kudakareta mysteria

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:14.580
Embraced in memories, the mysteria crumbles

00:22:09.100 --> 00:22:11.560
It's Pedro and Flores, the Valdés Siblings!

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:19.580
Higeki wo koete, odayaka na inori

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:19.580
Once you overcome this tragedy, offer a gentle prayer

00:22:15.020 --> 00:22:16.170
Burn, my flames!

00:22:16.170 --> 00:22:17.730
Zoom, my diabolical pitch!

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:23.700
Owari ga hajimari

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:23.700
Endings are just beginnings

00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:29.320
Shinsekai de hito wa mirai wo bishu no you ni

00:22:23.700 --> 00:22:29.320
People toss aside all they have without ever knowing

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:32.930
Nomi hoseru ka sae shirazu

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:32.930
If they could drink up the new world

00:22:30.170 --> 00:22:31.450
Strike!

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:36.040
Subete houri nageta

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:36.040
Like a savory wine

00:22:35.230 --> 00:22:38.170
Heidi, where's the container located?

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:42.230
Shinsekai wa tsumetai risei to kiseki no hazama

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:42.230
The new world resides between boring logic and miracles

00:22:38.170 --> 00:22:39.670
<i>Yeah, just give me a sec.</i>

00:22:40.220 --> 00:22:42.750
Let's go, Schwarze Frauen!

00:22:42.230 --> 00:22:50.830
Doushite koko de kimi to aeta no

00:22:42.230 --> 00:22:50.830
I wonder why this is where I first met you

00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:44.910
I need you to rush over to Murayama!

00:22:44.910 --> 00:22:45.630
Okay!

00:22:50.190 --> 00:22:52.470
Let's go, Jizuri Suzaku!

00:22:52.470 --> 00:22:54.630
Daddy! Mama!

00:22:55.420 --> 00:22:57.050
Think we'll be okay?

00:22:57.430 --> 00:22:58.980
Keep it together, Azuma!

00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:00.230
Oh, sorry.

00:23:03.290 --> 00:23:04.820
Here I go!

00:23:09.810 --> 00:23:11.300
Saa, dare ga

00:23:09.810 --> 00:23:11.300
Now, who

00:23:11.300 --> 00:23:12.940
Tsugeru no ka

00:23:11.300 --> 00:23:12.940
Will tell you what

00:23:11.630 --> 00:23:15.500
Well, shall we head on out?

00:23:12.940 --> 00:23:14.440
Hitan no hate

00:23:12.940 --> 00:23:14.440
You will lose once

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:19.780
Ushinau mono...

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:19.780
You reach the depths of grief...

00:23:16.500 --> 00:23:19.290
Let me show you the bunt of a lifetime!

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:27.880
Shinsekai de hito wa mirai wo bishu no you ni

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:27.880
People toss aside all they have without ever knowing

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:31.390
Nomi hoseru ka sae shirazu

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:31.390
If they could drink up the new world

