All ships, open 12% of your pool of ether reserves.

00:23:31.390 --> 00:23:34.460
Subete houri nageta

00:23:31.390 --> 00:23:34.460
Like a savory wine

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:35.260
Prepare entering gravitational navigation mode.

00:23:34.460 --> 00:23:40.500
Shinsekai wa tsumetai risei to kiseki no hazama

00:23:34.460 --> 00:23:40.500
The new world resides between boring logic and miracles

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:38.520
<i>The main ship has commenced transformation.</i>

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:40.940
<i>Entering gravitational navigation mode in three minutes.</i>

00:23:40.500 --> 00:23:50.740
Doushite koko de kimi to aeta no

00:23:40.500 --> 00:23:50.740
I wonder why this is where I first met you

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:43.780
<i>Then we will leave this airspace at maximum speed.</i>

00:23:43.780 --> 00:23:47.480
<i>I hope that everyone fighting for Musashi</i>

00:23:47.480 --> 00:23:49.530
<i>can pull through until then. Over.</i>

